fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"concepts.html#tinyff-concepts","fragment":"tinyff concepts\nThe following pages explain some of the philosophy and ideas within tinyff. They should be\nused by contributers when understanding how everything behind the scenes work, but can also\nbe read for fun if you want.\nBYO* philosophy: Our bring-your-own model for anything to make tinyff run on embeddable architecture and operating systems\nMore coming soon...\n"});